      "updated": 1786518591724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sometimes child class method is not satisfied with parent\nclass method's logic/body then in this case child class must\noverride the parent class method .\n\nBut if you need to call the parent class method from child\nclass you can use super keyword .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sometimes child class method is not satisfied with parent class method's logic/body then in this case child class must override the parent class method .\n\nBut if you need to call the parent class method from child class you can use super keyword .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
